  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "en": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Well, well{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00},{01 00 00 0a 00}{07 14 00} you're just on\nfire today!{01 00 00 05 00} {0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Vaata aga{01 07 00}!\n{01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00},{01 00 00 0a 00}{07 14 00} sa oled täna\nlausa hoos!{01 00 00 05 00} {0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Hello there{01 07 00}!\nHow are you, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?",
