  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "en": "{07 15 00}It's {04 08 00}:{04 09 00}, huh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 01 00} {07 1c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}My\npowder always wears off{01 00 00 05 00}\nright around lunch.\n{07 00 00}I{01 00 00 0a 00}{07 04 00} absolutely hate that!!!{01 00 00 14 00}\nOh, {01 00 00 05 00}where'd you come from?{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 06 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 15 00}Kell on {04 08 00}:{04 09 00},\nmis{01 00 00 05 00} .{01 00 00 05 00} .{01 00 00 05 00} .{01 01 00}{07 1c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00} Mu puuder kulub\nalati maha{01 00 00 05 00} just lõuna paiku.\n{07 00 00}Ma{01 00 00 0a 00}{07 04 00} vihkan seda täiesti!!!{01 00 00 14 00}\nOi, {01 00 00 05 00}kust sina tulid?{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 06 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "en": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Good evening{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00}\nHey, it's already\n{04 08 00} o'clock.",
   "et": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Tere õhtust{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00}\nHei, kell on juba\n{04 08 00}."
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Good evening{01 07 00}!\nHow are you, {04 1f 00}?",
